@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Iteration Delivery and Evidence Cycle
start
:Refine applicable backlog outcome and exact criteria;
:Check dependencies, current capacity and evidence gates;
:Record proposed goal and selected work;
:Refine only the design needed for the selected slice;
:Implement within authorized scope and owning boundaries;
:Run appropriate checks and record actual results;
if (Required evidence supports the selected outcome?) then (yes)
 :Demonstrate verified scope in Sprint Review;
else (no)
 :Record failed / blocked / unexecuted work
and truthful incomplete outcome;
endif
:Capture feedback, design changes and backlog follow-up;
:Record one actionable retrospective improvement;
:Select next demonstrable outcome using current evidence;
stop
@enduml
